Commands below run in Terminal as the fresh interactive user unless explicitly
prefixed â€œfrom Windowsâ€ or â€œthrough the existing SSH accountâ€. Replace only
`<draft-release-url>`, `<run-id>`, `<clean-user>`, and the recorded archive
filenames. Do not change the machine/profile midway.

### 7.1 Preflight and isolation

1. From Windows, confirm the documented host is reachable:

   ```powershell
