   1: # iolbox Debian 12/bookworm Lima template; render before passing to Lima.
   2: #
   3: # This profile is a CANDIDATE, canary-gated and UNVERIFIED on Apple Silicon
   4: # Rosetta. Debian 12 is an unpinned CANDIDATE and has no qualification row yet;
   5: # the live canary is authoritative. Image URL/digest and geometry are rendered
